From 4e171c3e7a08c60398b0572261144b42539c36b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Mar 2026 19:29:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix crashes, improve downloads, and clean up codebase

- Move synchronous image download (savePFP) off main thread to prevent UI freezes
- Add nil safety: bounds-check array accesses, guard property chains in didTapCopyInfoButton
- Fix download error handling: validate data/error before use, add timeouts, dispatch toasts to main thread
- Refactor duplicated speed/quality picker code in Settings.x into shared helper
- Replace deprecated UIGraphicsBeginImageContextWithOptions with UIGraphicsImageRenderer
- Make global state variables atomic (isOverlayShown, isTabSelected)
- Fix missing braces bug in Sideloading.x accessGroupID() causing incorrect control flow
- Uncomment yogaChildren property for bounds checking
- Add Photos and Security frameworks to Makefile, enable -Wall warnings

https://claude.ai/code/session_01UcaQutSb65F8VCdkD2dksB
